  "title": "How we built a coding agent that lives in Slack, and the recipe to build your own",
  "summary": "One of the busiest engineers at Bitrise doesn't have a laptop. It lives in Slack. Assign it a Jira ticket or @mention it in a thread, and it reads the requirements, posts a plan, spins up a cloud dev machine, writes and tests the code, opens a pull request, watches CI, and more. This is how we built Kolega.",
